Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: lock screen weather from Graphite Weather

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

---
 .../com/android/keyguard/GraphiteWeather.kt   | 95 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../keyguard/KeyguardUpdateMonitor.java       |  6 ++
 2 files changed, 101 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/keyguard/GraphiteWeather.kt

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/keyguard/GraphiteWeather.kt b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/keyguard/GraphiteWeather.kt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..575234df45c2a81e4417b10241b819566076e39e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/keyguard/GraphiteWeather.kt
@@ -0,0 +1,95 @@
